        "title": "If you don't have any encoders loaded the error messages aren't helpful",
        "body": "In issue #13773 a problem occured where the \"fips\" provider had been loaded but \"base\" had not. This resulted in a failure of the \"req\" command due to the lack of serializers:\r\n\r\n````\r\nGenerating a RSA private key\r\n..+.....+...............+............+.+.....+...+....+..+......+.......+..................+..+...+.......+.....+.+..+............+.+..+..........+...+.....+......+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++*..+...+..................+.+...+..+...+.+...............+.....+....+........+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++*....+......+......+.....+.+...+..+.......+........+...+.......+...+..+...+....+..+...+..........+..+...+.+.....+.......+...+..+.............+......+.....+.........+.+...........+.......+..+.............+.....+...+.........+....+.....+.+......+...+.........+...+..+......+......+.+...............+..............+....+...........+.+...+..+.........+.........+..........+..+.........+..........+........+............+......+...+.+...+...+...+..+.........+.+.....+.............+......+...+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\r\n....+.+......+...+..+...............+.......+.....+.+.........+.....+...+....+..............+.+.....+......+....+...+........+.......+..+....+.....+....+..+......+.......+..+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++*..+.......+......+..+.......+........+.......+...+...+.....+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++*.+.........+...+..+++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++\r\nwriting new private key to 'key.pem'\r\n0017A5C8DE7F0000:error::PEM routines:do_pk8pkey:error converting private key:crypto/pem/pem_pk8.c:127\r\n````\r\n\r\nI imagine that this is going to be a common problem. Can we improve the error reporting somehow, so that we can give a hint to our users what they need to do to solve this issue?",
